<title>ESTONIA: PENNU APRIL SALES UP 11.6 PCT VS MARCH.</title>
<headline>PENNU APRIL SALES UP 11.6 PCT VS MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennu computer technology said on Friday that its net turnover for April was 16.3 million kroons, an increase of 11.6 percent from March.</p>
<p>The growth in turnover compared to April 1996 was 2.5 times, the company said in a statement.  </p>
<p>From the computer assembler's turnover, exports increased by 20 percent and compared to April 1996, exports increased by 67 times, it added.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +371 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
